cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these records, please cite them as below, with the commit or the date of the state you used: they change every week."
type: dataset
title: "Aero Harness operator records"
abstract: >-
  The public records of the Aero Harness, the private inspection runtime of
  Ashforde OÜ (osaühing: a private limited company registered in Estonia).
  The calibration record lists every automated check of the runtime (each
  called a gate), its re-proof interval and its controls, and every dated
  proof that the gate could still fail on a planted defect. The evidence
  log is an append-only Merkle-tree log of commitments to the records the
  runtime issues, in weekly timestamped checkpoints. They are published so
  that they can be checked rather than trusted. Every control is written by
  the operator: this is self-calibration, and it is not a certification.
  The records are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International, and the verifier published with them under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0.
